```xml
<Record name="ArchiveLetter" type="delimited" fieldDelimiter="|" recordDelimiter="\n" nullValue="__NULL__">
  <Field name="letter_id" type="string" nullable="false"/>
  <Field name="sent_at" type="date" nullable="false" format="yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss" timeZone="UTC"/>
</Record>
```
Output port 0:
```xml
<Record name="ArchiveLetterEra" type="delimited" fieldDelimiter="|" recordDelimiter="\n" nullValue="__NULL__">
  <Field name="letter_id" type="string" nullable="false"/>
  <Field name="era" type="string" nullable="false"/>
</Record>
```

```ctl
//#CTL2
function integer transform() {
    $out.0.letter_id = $in.0.letter_id;
    if ($in.0.sent_at < zeroDate) {
        $out.0.era = "PRE_EPOCH";
    } else {
        $out.0.era = "EPOCH";
    }
    return ALL;
}
```

